### Signalizr read-only MCP
### All POSTs below are read-only MCP protocol operations, not message sends.

@baseUrl = {{$dotenv SIGNALIZR_BASE_URL}}
@protocolVersion = 2025-11-25

### Initialize
# @name initialize
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"method":"initialize","params":{"protocolVersion":"{{protocolVersion}}","capabilities":{},"clientInfo":{"name":"example-rest-client","version":"1.0.0"}}}

### Initialized notification
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
MCP-Protocol-Version: {{protocolVersion}}

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"notifications/initialized"}

### Discover tools
# @name listTools
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
MCP-Protocol-Version: {{protocolVersion}}

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":2,"method":"tools/list","params":{}}

### Count live gRPC application clients
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
MCP-Protocol-Version: {{protocolVersion}}

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":3,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"get_signalizr_status","arguments":{}}}

### List resolved group names
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
MCP-Protocol-Version: {{protocolVersion}}

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":4,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"get_signalizr_groups","arguments":{}}}

### Read message history (separate opt-in required; may expose private text)
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
MCP-Protocol-Version: {{protocolVersion}}

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":5,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"get_signalizr_messages","arguments":{"groupName":"My Test Group Name","count":5}}}

### Expected tool error: count outside the allowed range (history must be enabled)
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
MCP-Protocol-Version: {{protocolVersion}}

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":6,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"get_signalizr_messages","arguments":{"groupName":"My Test Group Name","count":51}}}
